# Bookmarks - dolphin (actions/actions_bookmarks.kbd)
**bookmarks + a** -- Trash
**bookmarks + b** -- Bookcase
**bookmarks + c** -- Scans
**bookmarks + d** -- Downloads
**bookmarks + e** -- Enaire
**bookmarks + f** -- Photo
**bookmarks + g** -- Guacimara
**bookmarks + h** -- Home
**bookmarks + i** -- Inbox
**bookmarks + j** -- Projects
**bookmarks + k** -- Kanata
**bookmarks + m** -- Main
**bookmarks + o** -- Screenshots
**bookmarks + p** -- Personal
**bookmarks + r** -- Resources
**bookmarks + s** -- Settings
**bookmarks + t** -- Tmp
**bookmarks + v** -- Dev
**bookmarks + w** -- Workarea
